Alexander Poquet <atpoquet@ucdavis.edu> wrote:

> I went to http://ftp.digital.com/pub/DEC/Alpha/firmware and followed the
> instructions for my hardware, acquiring a file called lx164_v5_8.exe.  I
> formatted a FAT floppy and renamed this file to 'fwupdate.exe' (as per the
